{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;SE3 Protocol: Last Drop&quot; is an horror puzzle game in the New Weird genre,\u00a0inspired by SCP Foundation,\u00a0</strong><strong><i>Lobotomy Corporation and the Witch's House</i></strong><strong>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We deliver a unique experience through immersive atmosphere, distinctive story &amp; worldview, and puzzle mechanics centered around understanding and utilizing monster natures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/ef3ec1e97e9fb63718e4925e2b2e7a76.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as Wei, The Foundation's ace investigator and embark on a thrilling journey through vast and mysterious ruins. As you search for an escape, you'll gather clues, uncover hidden truths, and attempt to reshape your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/8d6aadf2bb647cdf5ed1c3f6c9ae89b4.poster.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/8d6aadf2bb647cdf5ed1c3f6c9ae89b4.webm?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/8d6aadf2bb647cdf5ed1c3f6c9ae89b4.mp4?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, you may encounter the abnormal creatures The Foundation calls E Entities. But don't worry\u2014they are not as invincible as the movies and games make them seem, and you are not defenseless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/a1c2019a811df6c44e4b12f183aa50bc.poster.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/a1c2019a811df6c44e4b12f183aa50bc.webm?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/a1c2019a811df6c44e4b12f183aa50bc.mp4?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities vary in form, ability, and nature. It's natural for humans to avoid danger, but only by confronting and comprehending them is it possible to harness them\u2014and ultimately rise above them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/989f5bdf404e2c82238d3d13004295ad.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger looms at every turn, but retreat is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abide by the protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not give up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not <span class=\"bb_strike\">s#%^&amp;d@0e</span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This game is not recommended for children or those with a low tolerance for psychological stress or trauma.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419510?t=1751859949","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419510?t=1751859949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/78ba9dccc90baa5111ea9308ccbd864644c97d8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751859949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/78ba9dccc90baa5111ea9308ccbd864644c97d8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751859949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\u203b This game contains cartoon violence, mild abuse and self-harm, and is not recommended for children or those with a low tolerance for psychological stress or trauma."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;SE3 Protocol: Last Drop&quot; is an horror puzzle game in the New Weird genre,\u00a0inspired by SCP Foundation,\u00a0</strong><strong><i>Lobotomy Corporation and the Witch's House</i></strong><strong>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We deliver a unique experience through immersive atmosphere, distinctive story &amp; worldview, and puzzle mechanics centered around understanding and utilizing monster natures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/ef3ec1e97e9fb63718e4925e2b2e7a76.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as Wei, The Foundation's ace investigator and embark on a thrilling journey through vast and mysterious ruins. As you search for an escape, you'll gather clues, uncover hidden truths, and attempt to reshape your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/8d6aadf2bb647cdf5ed1c3f6c9ae89b4.poster.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/8d6aadf2bb647cdf5ed1c3f6c9ae89b4.webm?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/8d6aadf2bb647cdf5ed1c3f6c9ae89b4.mp4?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, you may encounter the abnormal creatures The Foundation calls E Entities. But don't worry\u2014they are not as invincible as the movies and games make them seem, and you are not defenseless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/a1c2019a811df6c44e4b12f183aa50bc.poster.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/a1c2019a811df6c44e4b12f183aa50bc.webm?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/a1c2019a811df6c44e4b12f183aa50bc.mp4?t=1751859949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities vary in form, ability, and nature. It's natural for humans to avoid danger, but only by confronting and comprehending them is it possible to harness them\u2014and ultimately rise above them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419510/extras/989f5bdf404e2c82238d3d13004295ad.avif?t=1751859949\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger looms at every turn, but retreat is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abide by the protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not give up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not <span class=\"bb_strike\">s#%^&amp;d@0e</span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This game is not recommended for children or those with a low tolerance for psychological stress or trauma.</p>","developers":["YMS Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass